<!-- Themed-icon (monochrome) layer: the full-colour icon artwork
     (mipmap-*/ic_launcher_foreground.png) traced as one flat shape - the
     back card offset up-left, the front card in front of it with a thin gap,
     and "LI / NK" knocked out of the front card. The artwork itself can't be
     this layer: the system only uses a layer's alpha, and the artwork is an
     opaque square. Without this, themed-icon launchers kept showing the
     previous design.

     Sized to stay inside the 66dp circle centred in the 108x108 canvas, the
     tightest mask a launcher applies. -->
